OL,3,GNEWSAIs there a way of stopping repeat
OL,4,Ashoplifting?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPersistent shoplifters are often caught
OL,7,Fin a cycle of police, courts and
OL,8,Fprison, says a charity which is calling
OL,9,Ffor more joined up support to be made
OL,10,Favailable.
OL,12,FRevolving Doors says homelessness, poor
OL,13,Fmental health and poverty are often
OL,14,Fdriving this repeat offending.
OL,16,FPolice forces in England and Wales
OL,17,Frecorded 502,011 shoplifting offences
OL,18,Fin 2025-26, a 5% drop on the year
OL,19,Fbefore but higher than pre-pandemic
OL,20,Flevels.
